    "notes": {
        "bcc229b2-31f7-4352-9705-be96b6454626": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 592,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 240,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Polling triggers\n\nMiro has no webhooks (the experimental board subscriptions were removed on 2025-12-05). Each trigger records where the team stands on its first check and then checks every minute, so the board is created after a 2-minute Wait and updated after another one. Do not remove the Waits: Updated Board must have seen the board before it changes. Miro does not move a board's modifiedAt when only its description changes, so Updated Board compares the board's fields too. The flow creates one board and deletes it at the end; a Free team allows at most 3 editable boards."
        }
    }
